      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "shannon/auth",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "JWT token storage in localStorage without HttpOnly protection combined with stored XSS in name field. JWT tokens are stored in localStorage as dakly_auth_token without HttpOnly cookie protection, making them vulnerable to theft via XSS attacks. Combined with stored XSS vulnerability in the registration name field, attackers can steal authentication tokens and hijack user sessions.",
            "markdown": "**JWT token storage in localStorage without HttpOnly protection combined with stored XSS in name field**\n\nJWT tokens are stored in localStorage as dakly_auth_token without HttpOnly cookie protection, making them vulnerable to theft via XSS attacks. Combined with stored XSS vulnerability in the registration name field, attackers can steal authentication tokens and hijack user sessions.\n\n**Impact**\n\nAttackers can execute XSS payloads to steal JWT tokens from localStorage, enabling complete session hijacking and account takeover. The stored XSS vulnerability in the name field creates a persistent attack vector where malicious user names execute JavaScript whenever viewed.\n\n**Remediation**\n\n1. Store JWT tokens in HttpOnly, Secure cookies instead of localStorage. 2. Implement proper input validation and output encoding for user-supplied content (name field). 3. Add Content Security Policy (CSP) headers to restrict script execution. 4. Implement strict CORS policies and use the SameSite attribute for cookies.\n\nFull exploitation evidence: `Security-Assessment-Report.pdf`"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "frontend/src/App.jsx"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 27,
                  "endLine": 27
                }
              },
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "name": "useState localStorage getItem",
                  "kind": "function"
                }
              ],
              "message": {
                "text": "sink"
              }
            }
          ],
